  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dusangirijambo Coffee Production and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project seeks investment to build a warehouse, drying beds, coffee collection centers, a waste collection system and to purchase crop and a new coffee pulping machine to replace the old one. It will also cover the training in various topics to help the cooperative to sustain its intervention.</narrative>
  </description>
